        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock TK6861, Trelawny Lever Trim Kit for Handlesets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDoralLock's Trelawny Lever would look great in almost any home. This traditional lever is made out of solid brass and is available in 7 finishes. The Trelawny Lever Inside Trim Kit used with the DoralLock <a href=\"/products/hanover-single-cylinder-handleset-dorallock-803871b\">Hanover Handleset</a> and the <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-montego-handleset-dorallock-810871\">Montego Handleset</a>. This is an replacement inside handle kit for these handelsets only as it is just the lever and rosette.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here or a complete <a href=\"/products/trelawny-door-lever-dorallock-6860\">Trelawny Lever Set</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DoralLock TK6861 Trelawny Lever Trim Kit:\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-TK6861-specifications.pdf?v=1704262207\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock TK6861 Trelawny Trim Kit (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/door-handing-picture.gif?v=1704352978\" border=\"0\" width=\"410\" height=\"150\" alt=\"door handing - left or right handed lever\">\r\n</p>",
